zork3 (0~git20251120.3ec9ed4-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian release.
  * Package the MIT-licensed historical Zork III source snapshot released by
    Microsoft.
  * Install the upstream-provided Z-machine version 3 story image and run it
    with Frotz.
  * Add desktop integration, a manual page, upstream metadata, a watch file,
    and autopkgtests.
  * Document the provenance and rebuild limitations of the historical story
    image in debian/README.source.

